{
  "about": "What Strapi 5's entity validator checks beyond a field's own value, checked against strapi-php with api.documents.strictRelations on (as a new Strapi project ships it): a unique field (a uid always is) among the other entries, and among a repeatable component's items; a required relation and file, in each shape a write can send them; and a blocks field's document tree, node by node. Run on an empty database, in order, with strapi-populate-vectors.mjs. An error's details are compared, as they name each failing field.",
